WEBVTT

00:00:29.734 --> 00:00:31.652
and I’ve made them home,

00:00:31.652 --> 00:00:32.653
like New York,

00:00:32.653 --> 00:00:34.405
which I’ve fallen in love with --

00:00:34.405 --> 00:00:35.490
and in.

00:00:35.573 --> 00:00:39.452
But I always felt
like my biggest strength

00:00:39.452 --> 00:00:43.164
came from the fact that I knew
exactly where I came from.

00:00:43.623 --> 00:00:46.501
And that knowledge
was very important to me

00:00:46.501 --> 00:00:49.545
because it really defines
who I am as a woman.

00:00:50.588 --> 00:00:53.424
But growing up in Lebanon
comes with a price.

00:00:53.424 --> 00:00:56.886
I think this tension and this --

00:00:56.886 --> 00:01:00.973
what I have between my home country 
is something I cherish